<pdd-reason>Every library reader and writer must resolve the same active per-volume SQLite at call time; a module-import-time path would keep writing the previous collection after a live GUI switch.</pdd-reason>
<pdd-interface>
{"type":"module","module":{"functions":[
  {"name":"current_index_path","signature":"current_index_path(path: Path | None = None) -> Path"},
  {"name":"connect","signature":"connect(path: Path | None = None) -> sqlite3.Connection"},
  {"name":"configured_roots","signature":"configured_roots(path: Path | None = None) -> list[str]"},
  {"name":"scan_status","signature":"scan_status(path: Path | None = None) -> dict"},
